  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">RPG 藥水 &ndash; 專為 PvP 設計，新增一系列全新藥水，旨在徹底改變玩家於戰鬥中的對抗方式。這些藥水不僅僅是提升傷害或生命值，更會引入影響視野、機動性、敵情判斷與即時決策的效果，讓 PvP 戰局更具策略性且難以預測。雖然主要為決鬥與競技場設計，但其實用效果同樣適用於 PvE、團隊副本、陣營戰與自訂地圖，為整體遊戲體驗增添多樣性與深度。 </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">大部分藥水都允許您透過模組的設定檔，自行調整效果的強度、持續時間或運作方式。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">1 - 煙霧藥水 - 投擲後會釋放出煙霧雲，遮蔽周圍視野，藉此混淆對手、中斷追擊或掩護自身移動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">2 - </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">誘餌藥水 - 生成一個短暫的分身誘餌，模擬玩家的存在並吸引敵人注意，極適合用於欺敵、引開火力或戰術性撤退。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">3 - 衝擊藥水 - 製造一圈震波將附近敵人推開，可用於拉開距離、將敵人擊落橋樑或高地，或是中斷近戰攻擊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">4 - 幽靈護甲藥水 - 提供數秒鐘的臨時防護層，完全減免前 2 至 3 次受到的傷害，讓你能夠無懲罰地切入或脫離戰鬥。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">5 - 輕度麻痹藥水 - 降低對手的機動性與反應速度數秒，使其在激烈交戰時難以逃脫或立即反擊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">6 - 彈道反彈藥水 - 使接收到的投射物暫時反彈，使其飛回射擊者身邊並造成傷害，將遠程交火的劣勢轉為優勢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">7 - 熱感標記藥水 - 標記敵人並在短時間內揭露其位置，讓追蹤、追捕與控制隱匿目標變得更加輕鬆。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">8 - 黑霧藥水 - 使對手螢幕變暗，妨礙其視野數秒，降低瞄準與方向判讀能力。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想要與朋友一同遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即取得專屬的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與好友享受無限冒險！我們提供頂級效能與穩定運行時間，確保每位玩家都能獲得流暢且愉快的遊戲體驗。使用折扣碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享有 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_discord.webp\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
